#. そんなんじゃ納得できないよ！
#. そうだよ…失くすわけないよ…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That doesn't make any sense! Come on, don't give up\n"
"now!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いくら俺がアホでもこればっかりはない！
#. 授業を受けた記憶も、証拠もねーんだから…
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I might be stupid, but I'm not THAT stupid! There's no\n"
"proof or memory that I ever went to class!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ホントに２年経ってたら…
#. 俺は…俺は…青春の何％を失ったんだべ！
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"If I've really lost two years, then...then...how much\n"
"of my youth have I lost already!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>２年間の記憶を丸ごと失っているなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We completely lost two years' worth of memories...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>信じたくないけど、でも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't want to believe it, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>信じたくないけど、でも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't want to believe it, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…知ってしまっている…
#. 失われた学生生活を裏付ける<CLT><CLT 3>証拠<CLT><CLT 4>を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...I know there's <CLT><CLT 3>evidence<CLT><CLT 4> that reveals the time as\n"
"students we lost...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
